## 2. 物理查询优化

### 2.1 NonAlloc API

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
// Raycast — 无分配
if (Physics.Raycast(origin, direction, out RaycastHit hit, maxDistance)) { }

// 多结果 — NonAlloc 版本
RaycastHit[] results = new RaycastHit[16];
int hitCount = Physics.RaycastNonAlloc(origin, direction, results, maxDistance);

// OverlapSphere — NonAlloc
Collider[] overlapResults = new Collider[32];
int count = Physics.OverlapSphereNonAlloc(center, radius, overlapResults);
```

❌ **错误**：
```csharp
RaycastHit[] hits = Physics.RaycastAll(origin, direction);  // 违规：每次分配新数组
Collider[] colliders = Physics.OverlapSphere(center, radius);  // 违规：同上
```

### 2.2 LayerMask 过滤

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
int enemyLayer = 1 << LayerMask.NameToLayer("Enemy");
if (Physics.Raycast(origin, direction, out RaycastHit hit, maxDistance, enemyLayer)) { }
```

### 2.3 Compound Collider > Mesh Collider

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
// 多个原始 Collider 组合（Box + Capsule + Sphere）
// 性能：O(1) 碰撞检测
```

❌ **错误**：
```csharp
// 单个 Mesh Collider
// 违规：O(n) 三角面遍历，仅用于静态几何
```

