## 4. 对象池

✅ **正确**（`ObjectPool<T>`）：
```csharp
using UnityEngine.Pool;

public class VFXPool : MonoBehaviour {
    [SerializeField] private GameObject vfxPrefab;
    private ObjectPool<GameObject> _pool;

    void Awake() {
        _pool = new ObjectPool<GameObject>(
            createFunc: () => Instantiate(vfxPrefab),
            actionOnGet: go => go.SetActive(true),
            actionOnRelease: go => go.SetActive(false),
            actionOnDestroy: Destroy,
            defaultCapacity: 20,
            maxSize: 100
        );
    }

    public void Play(Vector3 position) {
        var vfx = _pool.Get();
        vfx.transform.position = position;
        StartCoroutine(ReturnAfterDelay(vfx, 2f));
    }

    IEnumerator ReturnAfterDelay(GameObject go, float delay) {
        yield return new WaitForSeconds(delay);
        _pool.Release(go);
    }
}
```

❌ **错误**（频繁 Instantiate/Destroy）：
```csharp
void SpawnExplosion(Vector3 pos) {
    var vfx = Instantiate(explosionPrefab, pos, Quaternion.identity);  // 违规：GC 压力
    Destroy(vfx, 2f);  // 违规：销毁产生 GC
}
```

