## 6. 废弃 API 替代清单（Unity 6.3 LTS）

### Input 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `Input.GetKey()` | `Keyboard.current[Key.X].isPressed` |
| `Input.GetKeyDown()` | `Keyboard.current[Key.X].wasPressedThisFrame` |
| `Input.GetMouseButton()` | `Mouse.current.leftButton.isPressed` |
| `Input.GetAxis()` | `InputAction` 回调 |
| `Input.mousePosition` | `Mouse.current.position.ReadValue()` |

### UI 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `Canvas` (UGUI) | `UIDocument` (UI Toolkit) |
| `Text` 组件 | `TextMeshPro` 或 UI Toolkit `Label` |
| `Image` 组件 | UI Toolkit `VisualElement` + background |

### DOTS/Entities 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `ComponentSystem` | `ISystem`（unmanaged） |
| `JobComponentSystem` | `ISystem` + `IJobEntity` |
| `ComponentDataFromEntity<T>` | `ComponentLookup<T>` |
| `GameObjectEntity` | 纯 ECS 工作流 |

### Rendering 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `CommandBuffer.DrawMesh()` | RenderGraph API |
| `Camera.SetReplacementShader()` | 自定义 Render Pass |
| `OnPreRender()`/`OnPostRender()` | `RenderPipelineManager` 回调 |

### Physics 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `Physics.RaycastAll()` | `Physics.RaycastNonAlloc()` |
| `Rigidbody.velocity`（直接写） | `Rigidbody.AddForce()` |

### Asset Loading 废弃

| 废弃 API | 替代方案 |
|----------|----------|
| `Resources.Load()` | Addressables |
| 同步资源加载 | `Addressables.LoadAssetAsync()` |

### 迁移代码示例

```csharp
// ❌ 废弃：Input.GetKey
if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.Space)) { Jump(); }

// ✅ 替代：Input System
using UnityEngine.InputSystem;
if (Keyboard.current.spaceKey.wasPressedThisFrame) { Jump(); }
```

```csharp
// ❌ 废弃：Resources.Load
var prefab = Resources.Load<GameObject>("Enemies/Goblin");

// ✅ 替代：Addressables
var handle = Addressables.LoadAssetAsync<GameObject>("Enemies/Goblin");
await handle.Task;
var prefab = handle.Result;
```

```csharp
// ❌ 废弃：UGUI Text
GetComponent<Text>().text = "Score: 100";

// ✅ 替代：TextMeshPro
GetComponent<TextMeshProUGUI>().text = "Score: 100";
```

